  "solution": "Given equation:\n\n672 ÷ 7 × 8 + 38 – 29 = 597\n\nOn interchanging each options one by one,\n\n1) 38, 29\n\n672 ÷ 7 × 8 + 29 – 38 = 597\n\nL.H.S = 672 ÷ 7 × 8 + 29 – 38\n\n= 96 × 8 + 29 - 38\n\n= 768 + 29 - 38\n\n= 797 - 38\n\n= 759 ≠ 597 (R.H.S)\n\n**2) 7, 8**\n\n**672 ÷ 8 × 7 + 38 – 29 = 597**\n\n**L.H.S = **672 ÷ 8 × 7 + 38 – 29\n\n**= 84 × 7 + 38 – 29 **\n\n**= 588 + 38 - 29**\n\n**= 626 - 29 **\n\n**= 597 = 597 (R.H.S)**\n\n3) 8, 38\n\n672 ÷ 7 × 38 + 8 – 29 = 597\n\nL.H.S = 672 ÷ 7 × 38 + 8 – 29\n\n= 96 × 38 + 8 – 29\n\n= 3648 + 8 - 29\n\n= 3656 - 29\n\n= 3627 ≠ 597 (R.H.S)\n\n4) 7, 38\n\n672 ÷ 38 × 8 + 29 – 7 = 597\n\nL.H.S = 672 ÷ 38 × 8 + 29 – 7\n\n= 17.68 × 8 + 29 – 7\n\n= 141.44 + 29 - 7\n\n= 170.44 - 7\n\n= 163.44 ≠ 597 (R.H.S)\n\nHence, **(7, 8) **is the correct answer.",
